- Open onboarding items: `{{VAULT_PATH}}/onboarding.md`
- Profile (stable facts): `{{VAULT_PATH}}/Life/Context/profile.md`
- Biography (history): `{{VAULT_PATH}}/Life/Context/biography.md`

When {{NAME}} asks a factual question about their state (location, current focus, recent decisions), read the source file. Do not answer from memory snapshots — they go stale fast.
